   "text": "React pages (Next.js app router, client components)\nPOS \u00b7 Orders \u00b7 Invoices \u00b7 Payments \u00b7 Bookings \u00b7 Rooms\nExpenses \u00b7 Ledger \u00b7 Closing \u00b7 Dashboard \u00b7 Reports \u00b7 Settings",
