   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "AppProvider + Shell\nrenders from local data at once (never waits for the cloud)\nsync loop: on open \u00b7 online \u00b7 every 15 s \u00b7 'Sync now' \u00b7 SW message\nheader badge: Syncing\u2026 / N pending / N failed",
   "originalText": "AppProvider + Shell\nrenders from local data at once (never waits for the cloud)\nsync loop: on open \u00b7 online \u00b7 every 15 s \u00b7 'Sync now' \u00b7 SW message\nheader badge: Syncing\u2026 / N pending / N failed",
   "fontSize": 16,
