   "text": "AppService (src/domain/service.ts)\nin-memory AppState \u00b7 domain rules \u00b7 integer paise \u00b7 Asia/Kolkata dates\nevery mutation -> outbox item (mutation_id = queue id)\npush: batches \u2264100 / 512 KB \u00b7 pull: cursor, else legacy",
   "originalText": "AppService (src/domain/service.ts)\nin-memory AppState \u00b7 domain rules \u00b7 integer paise \u00b7 Asia/Kolkata dates\nevery mutation -> outbox item (mutation_id = queue id)\npush: batches \u2264100 / 512 KB \u00b7 pull: cursor, else legacy",
