   "text": "persist.ts + entity-store.ts\nfirst launch: copy legacy snapshot -> entity stores, validate, resume\nEntityWriter: writes only changed rows \u00b7 restores array order\nkill switch 'Use legacy storage' \u00b7 recovery points every 15 min",
