   "text": "IndexedDB  vattavada-business-manager-entities\ncustomers \u00b7 products \u00b7 rooms \u00b7 tables \u00b7 bookings \u00b7 orders \u00b7 orderItems\ninvoices \u00b7 invoiceItems \u00b7 payments \u00b7 expenses \u00b7 ledger \u00b7 dailyClosings\nshifts \u00b7 auditLogs \u00b7 conflicts  (indexed: business+date, parent id\u2026)\noutbox \u00b7 catalog \u00b7 sync_meta (cursor, order.*) \u00b7 archive_manifests",
   "originalText": "IndexedDB  vattavada-business-manager-entities\ncustomers \u00b7 products \u00b7 rooms \u00b7 tables \u00b7 bookings \u00b7 orders \u00b7 orderItems\ninvoices \u00b7 invoiceItems \u00b7 payments \u00b7 expenses \u00b7 ledger \u00b7 dailyClosings\nshifts \u00b7 auditLogs \u00b7 conflicts  (indexed: business+date, parent id\u2026)\noutbox \u00b7 catalog \u00b7 sync_meta (cursor, order.*) \u00b7 archive_manifests",
