   "text": "IndexedDB  vattavada-business-manager  (v2, legacy)\nsnapshots.primary: never cleared by the migration; persist.ts mirrors\nstate into it every 5 min for 30 days (rollback to the old client)\nsnapshots.recovery-*: 5 newest recovery points (every 15 min)",
