   "text": "/api/sync\nGET  ?health=1      configured \u00b7 cursor_sync \u00b7 sql_reports\nGET  ?after=SEQ     cursor page (\u2264500) + next_cursor \u00b7 409 resync\nGET  ?since=TS      legacy timestamp pull (old clients)\nPOST {items[\u2264100]}  one transaction per batch \u00b7 413 if too big",
   "originalText": "/api/sync\nGET  ?health=1      configured \u00b7 cursor_sync \u00b7 sql_reports\nGET  ?after=SEQ     cursor page (\u2264500) + next_cursor \u00b7 409 resync\nGET  ?since=TS      legacy timestamp pull (old clients)\nPOST {items[\u2264100]}  one transaction per batch \u00b7 413 if too big",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rectangle-36-3765cc1d",
