   "text": "Normalized tables (text ids, paise, business dates)\ncustomers \u00b7 product_categories \u00b7 products \u00b7 restaurant_tables \u00b7 rooms\nbookings \u00b7 orders \u00b7 order_items \u00b7 invoices \u00b7 invoice_items \u00b7 payments\nexpenses \u00b7 ledger_entries \u00b7 daily_closings \u00b7 shifts\n+ created/updated/deleted_at \u00b7 device_id \u00b7 version \u00b7 extra JSONB\n+ change_seq  (trigger: advisory lock + one global sequence)\n+ FKs ON DELETE RESTRICT \u00b7 partial/composite indexes",
   "originalText": "Normalized tables (text ids, paise, business dates)\ncustomers \u00b7 product_categories \u00b7 products \u00b7 restaurant_tables \u00b7 rooms\nbookings \u00b7 orders \u00b7 order_items \u00b7 invoices \u00b7 invoice_items \u00b7 payments\nexpenses \u00b7 ledger_entries \u00b7 daily_closings \u00b7 shifts\n+ created/updated/deleted_at \u00b7 device_id \u00b7 version \u00b7 extra JSONB\n+ change_seq  (trigger: advisory lock + one global sequence)\n+ FKs ON DELETE RESTRICT \u00b7 partial/composite indexes",
